  "shortenedStepsCount": 0,
  "parentName": "Dickson.sylow_pairwise_trivial_intersection",
  "oldText":
  "obtain ⟨g, ⟨hgP, hgQ⟩, hg_ne_one⟩ : ∃ g : G, g ∈ (P : Subgroup G) ⊓ (Q : Subgroup G) ∧ g ≠ 1 := by\n    by_contra h; apply h_int; ext x\n    exact ⟨fun hx ↦ by_contra fun hx_ne ↦ h ⟨x, hx, hx_ne⟩,\n           fun hx ↦ (Subgroup.mem_bot.mp hx).symm ▸ ⟨P.one_mem, Q.one_mem⟩⟩",
