 {"tacticSucceeded": false,
  "startLine": 450,
  "startCol": 2,
  "shortenedStepsCount": 0,
  "parentName": "Dickson.normalizer_complement_divides_main",
  "oldText":
  "have h_orbit_card : ∀ h : (P : Subgroup G), h ≠ 1 → Nat.card (MulAction.orbit (Subgroup.normalizer ((P : Subgroup G) : Set G)) h) = Nat.card (Subgroup.normalizer ((P : Subgroup G) : Set G)) / Nat.card P := by\n    intro h hh_ne\n    haveI : Nonempty (MulAction.stabilizer (Subgroup.normalizer ((P : Subgroup G) : Set G)) h) := ⟨1⟩\n    have e : ↥((P : Subgroup G).subgroupOf (Subgroup.normalizer ((P : Subgroup G) : Set G))) ≃ (P : Subgroup G) :=\n      ⟨fun x ↦ ⟨x.1.1, x.2⟩, fun x ↦ ⟨⟨x.1, Subgroup.le_normalizer x.2⟩, x.2⟩, fun _ ↦ rfl, fun _ ↦ rfl⟩\n    have h_stab : Nat.card (MulAction.stabilizer (Subgroup.normalizer ((P : Subgroup G) : Set G)) h) = Nat.card P := by\n      rw [stabilizer_conj_eq_P p G hG_p P h hh_ne]; exact Nat.card_congr e\n    have h_quot := Subgroup.card_eq_card_quotient_mul_card_subgroup\n      (MulAction.stabilizer (Subgroup.normalizer ((P : Subgroup G) : Set G)) h)\n    rw [h_stab] at h_quot\n    rw [Nat.card_congr (MulAction.orbitEquivQuotientStabilizer _ h), h_quot,\n        Nat.mul_div_cancel _ Nat.card_pos]",
  "message": null,
  "goalIsProp": true,
  "filepath": "/data/FLT/FLT/Slop/PGL2/FiniteSubgroups/PartitionHelpers.lean"},
 {"tacticSucceeded": false,
